[en.DECISION_C15_C11_FORMAL_PROTEST]
Deliever a Formal Protest

[en.DECISION_C15_C11_FORMAL_PROTEST_desc]
Changeling Empire is not satisfied with Crystal Empire’s execution of the Canterlot Pact, and strongly protests against Crystal Empire’s discrimination against changelings, demanding that Crystal Empire must immediately strengthen its care for changeling groups.

[en.DECISION_C15_C11_FORMAL_PROTEST_LESS_THAN_80_TOOLTIP]
To justify this protest, our advisory council have to own less than §Y80§! seats in the Crystal Empire Council, current seats: [?C15.parliament_seat_array^4|Y0].

[zh.DECISION_C15_C11_FORMAL_PROTEST]
呈交正式抗议书

[zh.DECISION_C15_C11_FORMAL_PROTEST_desc]
幻形灵帝国对于水晶帝国对《坎特洛特协定》的执行力度感到不满，对水晶帝国歧视幻形灵种族的行为提出强烈抗议，要求水晶帝国必须立即加强对于幻形灵群体的关怀。

[zh.DECISION_C15_C11_FORMAL_PROTEST_LESS_THAN_80_TOOLTIP]
为了正当化这一抗议，我们的顾问团必须在水晶帝国议会中拥有少于§Y80§!个席位，目前的席位：[?C15.parliament_seat_array^4|Y0]。
